msgid "EROFS - Enhanced Read-Only File System"
msgstr "EROFS - 增强型只读文件系统"

#: ../../src/index.md:10 4829da558e874bef86e2812e2a9fa438
msgid ""
"A modern, flexible, general-purpose, high-performance, block-based "
"immutable filesystem with a highly optimized on-disk format and runtime "
"implementation, designed for a variety of use cases—not just storage "
"space savings—while maintaining optimal runtime performance."
msgstr ""
 "一种现代、灵活、通用、高性能、基于块的不可变文件系统，具备高度优化的磁盘格式与运行时实现，适用于多种场景——不仅限于节省存储空间——同时保持最佳运行时性"
 "能。"

#: ../../src/index.md:15 1b4d8ec1308148c59f7c6d10b8f6464e
msgid ""
"[EROFS](https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/erofs.html) has been formally"
" available since Linux 5.4. It is currently maintained by an open-source "
"community from all over the world, and is still [under active "
"development](roadmap.md)."
msgstr ""
 "[EROFS](https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/erofs.html) 自 Linux 5.4 "
 "起正式发布。它目前由来自世界各地的开源社区维护，并且仍在[积极开发](roadmap.md)中。"

