#: ../../src/index.md:48 4a88dab72ee44ffa8e5728b2e5cded7a
msgid ""
"A modern filesystem more than just another archive format: EROFS is "
"_strictly_ block-aligned to maximize the data utilization of a single "
"disk I/O and enable advanced features like Direct I/O and FSDAX."
msgstr ""
 "现代文件系统不仅仅是又一种归档格式：EROFS _严格_ 按块对齐，以最大化单次磁盘 I/O 的数据利用率，并支持 Direct I/O、FSDAX "
 "等高级特性。"

